---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy - TechVerse" description="TechVerse ki Privacy Policy. Hum aapki privacy ka khayal rakhte hain.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold mb-8 dark:text-white">Privacy Policy 🔒</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-8">Last updated: September 1, 2026</p>

    <div class="prose-blog">
      <h2>Introduction</h2>
      <p>TechVerse ("hum", "humara", "humari website") aapki privacy ka poora khayal rakhta hai. Ye Privacy Policy batati hai ki hum aapka data kaise collect, use aur protect karte hain jab aap humari website <strong>techverseblogs.in</strong> visit karte hain.</p>

      <h2>Kya Information Hum Collect Karte Hain?</h2>
      <h3>Automatically Collected Information</h3>
      <p>Jab aap humari website visit karte hain, toh kuch information automatically collect hoti hai:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>IP address</li>
        <li>Browser type aur version</li>
        <li>Operating system</li>
        <li>Pages visited aur time spent</li>
        <li>Referring URL (kahan se aaye)</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Voluntarily Provided Information</h3>
      <p>Jab aap newsletter subscribe karte hain ya contact form fill karte hain:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Email address</li>
        <li>Name (optional)</li>
        <li>Message content</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Cookies & Tracking</h2>
      <h3>Google Analytics</h3>
      <p>Hum <strong>Google Analytics</strong> use karte hain website traffic analyze karne ke liye. Ye cookies use karta hai aapki browsing activity track karne ke liye. Aap apne browser settings se cookies disable kar sakte hain.</p>

      <h3>Google AdSense</h3>
      <p>Humari website pe <strong>Google AdSense</strong> ads dikhaye jaate hain. Google aur uske partners cookies use karte hain aapko relevant ads dikhane ke liye. Zyada jaankari ke liye visit karein: <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Policy</a></p>

      <h2>Affiliate Links</h2>
      <p>Humari kuch posts mein <strong>affiliate links</strong> hain (jaise Amazon, Flipkart). Jab aap in links se kuch khareedein, toh humein ek chhoti si commission milti hai — <strong>aapko koi extra cost nahi lagta</strong>. Hum sirf wohi products recommend karte hain jo hum genuinely acche maante hain.</p>

      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>Hum ye third-party services use karte hain:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> — traffic analysis</li>
        <li><strong>Google AdSense</strong> — advertising</li>
        <li><strong>Mailchimp</strong> — newsletter management</li>
        <li><strong>Vercel</strong> — website hosting</li>
      </ul>
      <p>In services ki apni privacy policies hain.</p>

      <h2>Data Security</h2>
      <p>Hum aapke data ki security ke liye reasonable measures lete hain, including SSL encryption (HTTPS). Lekin, internet pe koi bhi transmission 100% secure nahi hai.</p>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>Humari website 13 saal se kam umar ke bacchon ke liye nahi hai. Hum jaanbuujhkar bacchon ka data collect nahi karte.</p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>Hum ye privacy policy samay samay pe update kar sakte hain. Changes is page pe post kiye jayenge.</p>

      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>Privacy se related koi bhi sawal ho toh humse contact karo:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Email: <strong>aayush74550@gmail.com</strong></li>
        <li><a href="/contact">Contact Page</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
